{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BURGER Shot is a deliciously delightful burger puzzle game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merge burgers of the same type and watch them level up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful not to let them overflow off the counter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save a burger you want for later in your reserves,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >cleverly rotate each burger to hit the perfect angle,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and make the best use of your limited space to reach the highest score possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Score Attack]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep leveling up your burgers until they overflow off the counter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase your score and aim for the top of the world leaderboards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Time Attack]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race to make the highest-level burger, the King Burger, as fast as possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show off your fastest clear time and reach the top world rank!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Battle]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise your burger levels while sending disruptive drinks to your opponents!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategize your way to victory as the last one standing!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3915070?t=1755731824","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3915070?t=1755731824","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915070/4c036616e9c3e2ad603702a001e68246ccbdb71c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755731824","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915070/4c036616e9c3e2ad603702a001e68246ccbdb71c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755731824","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BURGER Shot is a deliciously delightful burger puzzle game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merge burgers of the same type and watch them level up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful not to let them overflow off the counter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save a burger you want for later in your reserves,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >cleverly rotate each burger to hit the perfect angle,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and make the best use of your limited space to reach the highest score possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Score Attack]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep leveling up your burgers until they overflow off the counter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase your score and aim for the top of the world leaderboards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Time Attack]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race to make the highest-level burger, the King Burger, as fast as possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show off your fastest clear time and reach the top world rank!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Battle]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise your burger levels while sending disruptive drinks to your opponents!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategize your way to victory as the last one standing!</p>","developers":["SAT-BOX"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915070/26d60fbdadf2334bb6286cd7e